`Blockchain/Dev/services/kyc/src/index.ts:235`. The catch block's `instanceof Error` read is on line 235; the catch logs 'DB get verification stats failed' at error level and does NOT rethrow: it returns zeros. The message is only logged, never returned to a caller or put in a response. CALLERS (git grep at the tip, kyc/src/index.ts): :557 (GET /health, no try; it puts stats.total/pending/approved, numbers only, in the response). No message reaches the response. A hostile throw today leaves the health endpoint unanswered (an unhandled rejection), which is the worst place for it. Only the three counts are in the /health body

